{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410435001:1":{"text":"女王陛下に栄光あれ！隊長、ご報告します！列に紛れ込んでいた印持ちの平民を発見しました！","source_cn":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD74C86F1868F943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410435002:1":{"text":"ぼ、僕はベルヴェの分を受け取りたくて……彼女はもう、体が……","source_cn":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037B6D3F7EBE6744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410435003:1":{"text":"お願いします！どうか、どうかベルヴェを助けてください！","source_cn":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61771932570AE04D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410435004:1":{"text":"本人が取りに来い！代理で受け取ることは法律で禁止されている！","source_cn":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A0B81741CE86B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410435005:1":{"text":"で、でも……ベルヴェも、印が……","source_cn":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A7FD1001E02691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410435006:1":{"text":"はっ！だったらなおさら無理な話だ！司祭様に印を刻まれたとういうことは、そいつも罪人なんだろ！","source_cn":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533BD077FC0B2E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410435007:1":{"text":"お願いします、どうか、どうか御慈悲を……！","source_cn":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2F04F3999034BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410435008:1":{"text":"ありがとう、ヴェクシャさん。どうすればいいか分かったよ……","source_cn":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF0F4E8E72F0E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410435009:1":{"text":"分かったならさっさと立ち去れ！","source_cn":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6B85A74E0C7EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410435010:1":{"text":"ああ、そうだ。戻る前にその女の居場所を教えろ。俺たちが処分しに行く。","source_cn":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2690421B342FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410435011:1":{"text":"いえ、彼女はまだ大丈夫です。もう戻らないと、ベルヴェが僕を待っているので……","source_cn":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57829F2BFA423FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410435012:1":{"text":"なんて……むごい……","source_cn":"你们……太欺负人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3849AC2284E00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410435013:1":{"text":"そろそろ交代の時間だ。","source_cn":"你，时候不早了，准备交接吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2B6D02C9B44BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410435014:1":{"text":"隊長、あの男を見張らなくて大丈夫ですか？もし……","source_cn":"卫队长，我们真的不用去盯着那小子吗？以防万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D97CE37AEF3809F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410435015:1":{"text":"……それは私が手配しておく。お前はもう戻って休め。","source_cn":"……无事，我稍后再安排。你早点回去休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71133FCED0E37672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410435016:1":{"text":"はっ！女王陛下に栄光あれ！","source_cn":"遵命！女王荣光永存！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F14F9E84621734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fema